n/Role Gate)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-18-resident-day-off-requests.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ApprovalQueue is deliberately a separate component, not inlined into RequestsTab's conditional-return body, because placing its hooks after early returns that fire conditionally across renders would violate the Rules of Hooks."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_07_18_resident_day_off_requests_task10_approval_queue", "label": "Task 10: Chief Approve/Deny Actions (ApprovalQueue)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-18-resident-day-off-requests.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Approval writes straight into the resident's existing approvedDatesOff array, the exact field getEligibleShifts/the generator/the grid already treat as a hard block \u2014 so no changes to the eligibility/generator engine are needed."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_07_18_resident_day_off_requests_task11_pending_badge", "label": "Task 11: Pending-Request Grid Marker + Sidebar Badge", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-18-resident-day-off-requests.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_07_18_resident_day_off_requests_task12_email_notify_function", "label": "Task 12: Email Notifications (Resend Edge Function)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-18-resident-day-off-requests.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fails soft \u2014 a Resend error is logged, not thrown, so a flaky email provider never blocks the underlying database write that triggered the webhook (fired a